### 실행 명령어

**Antigravity 담당 (GPU 0-1, 모델 5개)**:
```bash
# 그룹 A: Basic 3종 (순차 실행, GPU 0)
setsid nohup env CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 \
  /home/imnyj/venv/bin/python run_all.py \
  --models PPO SAC TD3 --seed 42 \
  > logs/training_groupA.log 2>&1 < /dev/null &

# 그룹 B: Latest 2종 (순차 실행, GPU 1)  
setsid nohup env CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=1 \
  /home/imnyj/venv/bin/python run_all.py \
  --models RES-MAPDDPG MA2HDQN --seed 42 \
  > logs/training_groupB.log 2>&1 < /dev/null &
```

**Claude 담당 (GPU 2-3, 모델 4개)**:
```bash
# 그룹 C: Latest 1종 + Similar 1종 (순차 실행, GPU 2)
setsid nohup env CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=2 \
  /home/imnyj/venv/bin/python run_all.py \
  --models I-HAMAPPO SPAM-D3QN --seed 42 \
  > logs/training_groupC.log 2>&1 < /dev/null &

# 그룹 D: Similar 2종 (순차 실행, GPU 3)
setsid nohup env CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=3 \
  /home/imnyj/venv/bin/python run_all.py \
  --models CARLTON MADDPG-MT --seed 42 \
  > logs/training_groupD.log 2>&1 < /dev/null &
```

